      "paragraphs": [
        "We are a trusted leader in simplified issue, no medical life insurance in Canada. That means no needles, no doctor visits and less waiting around.",
        "Getting covered is simple. If you’re between 18 and 80, healthy or “hard to insure,” you can find a plan!",
        "Yes, you probably do! Explore affordable life insurance coverage offered by Canada Protection Plan from Foresters Financial.",
        "This coverage could be right for you if:",
        "This coverage is right for you if:",
        "Explore coverage options",
        "Our simplified issue plans make it easy to get insured, even if you have existing health conditions or other factors that make you “hard to insure”.",
        "You’ll get straightforward Canadian life insurance coverage with no medical exams, no needles and less worries.",
        "You’ve got unique needs and goals. We’ve got the coverage to match, with less stress along the way.",
        "Our free insurance coverage calculator can help you out.",
        "Choose your insurance needs to see your personalized rates and Canadian life insurance plans.",
        "Get all your questions answered by a licensed Canadian life insurance advisor.",
        "Yes, Canada Protection Plan from Foresters Financial’s suite of life insurance products is available to Canadians 18-80 across the nation.",
        "Families, seniors, young adults or temporary residents Canada-wide benefit from life insurance to protect loved ones from financial burdens, regardless of health or lifestyle.",
        "Our coverage can potentially start as low as $15 a month. Get fast, affordable life insurance quotes in Canada using our Quick Quote tool – available online in just minutes.",
        "No medical life insurance in Canada lets you skip medical exams and needles, offering fast coverage in as little as 24 hours. It’s a great option even for those with health issues or high-risk hobbies, with coverage available up to $750,000.",
        "You can choose between term life insurance (e.g., 10-30 years) or whole life insurance (permanent coverage) for lifelong protection. Both offer protection tailored to your needs, with simplified and no medical options available nationwide.",
        "Use our Insurance Calculator to estimate coverage and apply for a no-obligation quote via phone (1-877-851-9090) or online."
      ],
